<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts U.S. oil drillers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts U.S. oil drillers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities initiated coverage on two oil drillers, Diamond Offshore Drilling Inc and UTI Energy Corp, assigning buy ratings to both, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
</text>
